The '''Catalyst''' is a {{Rare}} [[Minion Fuel]] item that multiplies minion resource generation by {{Green|3x}} for 3 hours. It triples the resources the minions would normally get from harvesting a block or a mob, therefore it doesn't actually have an impact on the time between actions. It is unlocked at {{CollectionLink|End Stone IX}}.

This can be upgraded to the [[Hyper Catalyst]].

