== Trivia ==
* Using a '''Catalyst''' on a minion for the first time awards the {{AchievementLink|At the speed of light|ach=y}}.
* '''Catalysts''' used to be commonly used to craft beacons. However, in [[Changelog/2019/November 18|an update]], they removed the ability to use a {{Item|Day Crystal}}, {{Item|Night Crystal}}, '''Catalyst''', or {{Item|Saving Grace}} to craft a {{Item|Beacon Block|text=Beacon}}.
* For some reason, the rarity of '''Catalysts''' is lower than that of the {{Item|Crystal Fragment}} used to craft it.
* Spreading upgrades (e.g. {{Item|Diamond Spreading}} and {{Item|Sleepy Hollow}}) will apply to the extra drops gained from '''Catalyst'''{{'}}s bonus.

